and other seasonings)

36
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,280
That should do it.

37
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:18,040
This kitchen is very professional.

38
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:19,400
(A professional-grade kitchen)
This kitchen is very professional.

39
00:02:19,920 --> 00:02:20,720
What are you making?

40
