49
00:02:40,420 --> 00:02:42,220
(4. Add the marinated ribs,
cover, and braise for 40 minutes)

50
00:02:43,660 --> 00:02:44,520
(See you in 40 minutes)
Right, good.

51
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,400
Let them braise slowly.

52
00:02:46,220 --> 00:02:47,900
(Our mouths are watering already)

53
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:50,320
Bing, are you planning
to stir-fry some bean sprouts?

54
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:51,100
(A polite way to order)

55
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,000
(One more dish added)
Sure, anything works.

56
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,120
We have a big stove, so order freely.

57
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:56,600
Does anyone want eggplant?

58
00:02:57,140 --> 00:02:59,020
(Memories of the past
come flooding back)

59
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,960
Put that down.

60
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:02,360
Do not pull that trick again.

61
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:03,600
(Please spare us)
Calm down.

62
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:05,520
Do you want to try
my eggplant, Chengcheng?

63
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:09,260
You know that sounds
like a threat, right?

64
00:03:09,260 --> 00:03:11,180
(Leaves disappointed)

65
