I'll make fried bean sauce later.

68
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:15,640
Fried bean sauce?

69
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:16,200
(Someone volunteered
for the only cooking step)

70
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:16,720
Here is what to do.

71
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:18,160
Wash these scallions.

72
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:19,180
(The head chef who only gives orders)

73
00:03:19,220 --> 00:03:20,180
(Apprentice Wang: Washing scallions)

74
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:20,880
Bai.

75
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,040
Wash some cilantro.

76
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:22,560
(Apprentice Bai: Washing cilantro)

77
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:22,920
All right.

78
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:23,960
Wash some chilies.

79
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:24,980
(Apprentice Hu: Washing chilies)

80
00:03:24,980 --> 00:03:25,520
(Blessed)

81
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,040
Jingyu.

82
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:27,480
Chop an onion.

83
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:28,780
