All right.

84
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:29,560
Be quick about it.

85
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,160
Sure!

86
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:31,060
(Hardest part of cooking is all the talking)

87
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:33,960
The veggie platter is ready.

88
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:36,440
You made them? Was that not my job?

89
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:37,600
