Me!

95
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:43,800
All right, chop a few potatoes.

96
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:44,760
I will do it.

97
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:45,200
I will do it!

98
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:45,490
No.

99
00:03:45,490 --> 00:03:46,070
I will do it!

100
00:03:46,070 --> 00:03:47,020
Let me do it!

101
00:03:47,340 --> 00:03:49,380
(Genuinely eager to help)

102
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,080
