Four.

104
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:52,960
Green pepper potato stir-fry.
A classic dish.

105
00:03:52,980 --> 00:03:53,560
(A masterpiece)

106
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,280
Excellent.

107
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:55,500
