110
00:03:58,200 --> 00:04:00,760
They need to turn golden brown
before you can add anything else.

111
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:01,360
Got it.

112
00:04:01,380 --> 00:04:04,420
(3. Add minced scallion, ginger,
garlic, torn peppers, and seasonings)

113
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:06,000
(4. Cover and cook for 40 seconds)
Cover and cook for 40 seconds.

114
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:06,900
(Green pepper potato stir-fry:
Ready to serve)

115
00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:07,700
The sauce has thickened nicely.

116
00:04:07,740 --> 00:04:09,740
(Stir-fried pork with bean sprouts:
1. Pour oil into the pan)

117
00:04:09,740 --> 00:04:11,340
(2. Fry shredded pork, garlic,
and chilies in batches)

118
00:04:11,340 --> 00:04:15,900
(3. Once fragrant, add the bean sprouts
and stir-fry over high heat)

119
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:16,640
Perfect!

120
00:04:18,460 --> 00:04:19,940
(4. Add light soy sauce,
dark soy sauce, vinegar,)

121
00:04:19,940 --> 00:04:21,300
(pepper, chicken bouillon, and sugar)

122
00:04:22,140 --> 00:04:23,660
(Stir-fried pork with bean sprouts:
Ready to serve)

123
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:24,760
All right.

124
