146
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,840
Please, come inside.

147
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,400
Here we are.

148
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:17,400
Try my hand-pulled noodles.

149
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,000
They are chewy.

150
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,560
Bing. I will take care of the arrangements.

151
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:22,320
Bing.

152
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:23,720
How is everything?

153
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:25,800
Everyone keeps asking about the food.

154
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,120
It will be ready soon.

155
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:30,880
