156
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,720
Once I make the bean sauce, we are done.

157
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,760
This dish will be ready in a moment.

158
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,160
It smells wonderful.

159
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,000
I will take care of it.

160
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:37,800
