162
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,160
Here they come.

163
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:46,120
All right, coming through.

164
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:46,800
One serving of Xu Fu Fried Rice!

165
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:47,640
Xu Fu Fried Rice!

166
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:50,120
Everyone, enjoy your meal.

167
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,560
Nothing matters more than eating well.

168
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,200
Thank you.

169
00:05:59,320 --> 00:05:59,960
This is delicious.

170
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,440
Enjoy your meal.

171
00:06:03,940 --> 00:06:05,660
