172
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,120
Bing, how is everything?

173
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:06,600
It is ready.

174
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:06,960
Almost.

175
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:11,120
