176
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:12,560
The salad.

177
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:13,840
The salad?

178
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:15,520
Something healthy.

179
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:16,560
Healthy. Extremely healthy.

180
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,280
All right.

181
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:18,200
What more is there to say?

182
00:06:19,100 --> 00:06:20,700
(Huang Jingyu's salad: 1. Finely chop
the cucumber, tomatoes, and onion)

183
00:06:20,700 --> 00:06:22,880
(2. Drizzle with olive oil)

184
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:23,640
I will make some tofu, too.

185
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:26,240
Can firm tofu be eaten
without cooking it?

186
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,160
Tofu doesn't need to be simmered.

187
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,800
But if you are going to simmer it,

188
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:30,720
you should use firm tofu.

189
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:32,640
I will make tofu
without simmering it, then.

190
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:34,440
What do you mean?

191
00:06:35,180 --> 00:06:36,580
(Just wait and see)

192
00:06:36,620 --> 00:06:38,500
(Huang Jingyu's spinach and tofu:
1. Add the spinach to boiling water)

193
00:06:38,500 --> 00:06:39,940
(2. Remove the spinach)

194
00:06:39,940 --> 00:06:41,100
(3. Add the tofu to the boiling water)

195
00:06:41,100 --> 00:06:42,100
(4. Remove the tofu
and rinse it in cold water)

196
00:06:42,100 --> 00:06:43,400
(5. Arrange everything on a plate.
No need to learn this step)

197
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:44,960
I am starving.

198
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:46,420
(Blanched spinach and tofu:
Oil-free, low in calories)

199
00:06:46,460 --> 00:06:49,660
(Egg and soybean paste: 1. Pour oil
into the pan. Once hot, add the eggs)

200
00:06:49,660 --> 00:06:51,220
(2. Scramble the eggs, then set them aside)

201
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:52,260
(3. Fry scallions, garlic, soybean
paste, five-spice, and seasonings in oil)

202
00:06:52,260 --> 00:06:53,180
(4. Return the eggs to the pan and stir-fry)

203
00:06:55,100 --> 00:06:56,340
(Egg and soybean paste: Ready to serve)

204
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:57,760
Just cook the sauce down over high heat.

205
00:06:58,460 --> 00:06:59,940
(Clay-pot ribs with cowpeas:
5. Add salt to the pot)

206
00:06:59,940 --> 00:07:01,600
(6. Add cilantro)

207
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,240
Wait a moment.

208
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,160
It's done when the liquid evaporates.

209
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:04,400
(7. Reduce the sauce
over high heat until dry)

210
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,080
If I stay here one second longer,

211
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:06,440
I will start drooling on the floor.

212
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:10,160
Pick the slightly burnt pieces.

213
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:15,000
This looks absolutely delicious.

214
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:16,720
We can finally eat.

215
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:17,700
(Clay-pot ribs with cowpeas:
Ready to serve)

216
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:18,960
The dishes are here.

217
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:20,480
Hurry up and eat.

218
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,440
These dishes are best enjoyed hot.

219
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:23,480
They smell amazing.

220
00:07:32,540 --> 00:07:35,300
(Eating at lightning speed)

221
00:07:39,740 --> 00:07:42,980
(Hu Xianxu)

222
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:44,900
(Wang Anyu)

223
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:45,480
Delicious.

224
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:46,360
What was it called?

225
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,320
Delicious.

226
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:51,200
The cowpeas have won you over, right?

227
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:52,520
It smells amazing.

228
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:54,620
(Bai Jingting)

229
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:55,920
It is delicious.

230
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,720
Try these beans.

231
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:58,160
I did. The beans are incredibly delicious.

232
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,800
