240
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:13,880
Just pack it in a plastic container.

241
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:15,400
(Not a single person wants any)

242
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:16,480
You can take it home later.

243
00:08:21,340 --> 00:08:22,780
(Here comes what we really want to eat)

244
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,360
I feel like I am back
in Northeast China wherever I go.

245
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:27,840
It feels so much like home.

246
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,560
Is that really your home?

247
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:31,120
You say that so casually.

248
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:35,000
This pickled cabbage soup...

249
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,500
(Don't miss the soup)
Pickled cabbage soup.

250
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,120
We have to try this.

251
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,240
We absolutely must.

252
00:08:39,560 --> 00:08:40,760
We definitely have to try it.

253
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:42,600
(Advice from an experienced food lover)
The pork bones taste even better.

254
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,760
(Recommending it to everyone equally)
Have a bowl of pickled cabbage soup?

255
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:45,480
Sure.

256
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,400
Churan, do you eat the meat
on the bones?

257
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:48,400
Sure.

258
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,760
You don't eat fatty meat, right?

259
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:50,560
No, I do not.

260
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:52,040
They're way too fatty. Who could eat

261
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:52,600
that much?

262
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,240
I will have them!

263
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:53,680
Me.

264
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:54,760
I can eat them.

265
