00:18:18,580 --> 00:18:19,660
(This is an easy choice for me)

542
00:18:20,060 --> 00:18:22,420
(Who could make your clothing brand a hit?)
Bai and Teng.

543
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:23,920
I don't think I'd make the cut.

544
00:18:24,080 --> 00:18:26,560
I voted for Bing
and Bai because the three

545
00:18:27,120 --> 00:18:29,080
of us are around the same age.

546
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:32,320
Sorry, Bai.

547
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:35,920
You two.

548
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:36,840
Trust me.

549
00:18:36,840 --> 00:18:39,280
Our team agrees on Teng and Bai.

550
00:18:39,280 --> 00:18:39,520
Alright.

551
00:18:39,540 --> 00:18:41,540
(Contestants: Bai Jingting and Shen Teng)

552
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:42,920
We should definitely pick Churan, right?

553
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:43,760
She's bound to get votes.

554
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:44,640
How about Mr. Huang?

555
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:45,200
Okay.

556
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:47,400
(Contestants: Wang Churan and Huang Jingyu)
You four, stand up.

557
00:18:47,840 --> 00:18:48,760
Stand up?

558
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:51,060
I can't.

559
00:18:51,060 --> 00:18:52,140
(My belly's in the way)

560
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:53,400
He can't do it.

561
00:18:53,420 --> 00:18:54,340
(Helping out)

562
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:56,040
You can rest your belly on the table.

563
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:57,760
The table's too low.

564
00:18:59,160 --> 00:19:00,840
The losing team must bow 90 degrees

565
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:02,600
(The losing team must bow and say "I give up")
and say "I give up."

566
00:19:02,700 --> 00:19:03,900
(A battle for dignity)

567
00:19:03,940 --> 00:19:05,620
(Their reputations are on the line)

568
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:08,120
Who's gonna win?

569
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:09,000
The winners are...

570
00:19:14,840 --> 00:19:15,600
The winners are...

571
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:18,080
Teng and Bai.

572
00:19:18,080 --> 00:19:18,760
Nine to seven.

573
00:19:18,760 --> 00:19:20,220
(Jingting: 3, Teng: 6, Total: 9. Winners)

574
00:19:20,220 --> 00:19:21,700
(Churan: 3, Jingyu: 4, Total: 7)

575
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:24,680
Who would've thought?

576
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:26,400
Getting into fashion early really pays off.

577
00:19:27,100 --> 00:19:28,980
(Riding the wave)

578
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:30,000
I owe it all to you.

579
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:30,940
(Thanks to you. You're too kind)

580
00:19:33,680 --> 00:19:35,040
I'm afraid I'm gonna throw up right here.

581
00:19:35,880 --> 00:19:36,560
Not because of you guys.

582
00:19:36,560 --> 00:19:37,760
I just ate way too much.

583
00:19:38,320 --> 00:19:39,440
You can bend backward instead.

584
00:19:40,840 --> 00:19:42,480
I'm sorry. I give up.

585
00:19:45,160 --> 00:19:46,680
Not bad. That was pretty sincere.

586
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:49,380
Let's reveal the vote counts.

587
00:19:49,380 --> 00:19:49,660
(Vote results)

588
00:19:49,660 --> 00:19:49,960
(Bing: 1, Bai: 3, Hu: 1, Teng: 6)

589
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:51,800
(Chengcheng: 3, Churan: 3, Anyu: 1, Jingyu: 4)
Teng got

590
00:19:52,200 --> 00:19:52,880
the most votes, with six.

591
00:19:53,100 --> 00:19:56,500
(Can't contain the excitement)

592
00:19:57,700 --> 00:19:59,180
(Cheering continues)

593
00:19:59,640 --> 00:20:00,320
You guys have great taste.

594
00:20:01,020 --> 00:20:02,220
(So I was riding on his coattails)

595
00:20:02,780 --> 00:20:03,900
(Classy)

596
00:20:04,000 --> 00:20:05,240
I voted for Teng,

597
00:20:05,240 --> 00:20:07,040
Mr. Huang, and Churan.

598
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:09,520
Them? Wearing your brand's clothes?

599
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:11,200
They represent three

600
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:12,520
rather extreme body types.

601
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:13,900
(Extreme body types)

602
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:15,480
Extreme?

603
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:16,260
(Even I couldn't
come up with something that insulting)

604
00:20:17,540 --> 00:20:19,020
(How infuriating)

605
00:20:19,560 --> 00:20:20,600
I picked the two older guys

606
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:23,080
because I think there's a huge market

607
00:20:23,560 --> 00:20:24,280
for men's formalwear.

608
00:20:24,980 --> 00:20:27,540
(Gudubai targets men's formalwear,
with Shen Teng and Jia Bing as models)

609
00:20:27,760 --> 00:20:28,560
Guess I wasn't thinking big enough.

610
00:20:31,080 --> 00:20:34,200
(Old money style)
I picked Teng for the old-money look.

611
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:36,200
(Macho style)
Jingyu represents the macho look.

612
00:20:36,200 --> 00:20:37,600
Chengcheng represents trendy style.

613
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:38,820
(Trendy style)

614
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:41,040
Our three clothing brands
have this covered.

615
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:42,040
Let's take on GOODBAI.

616
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:46,360
Let's just swallow it whole. Acquire it.

617
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:50,240
GOODBAI already

618
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:51,640
has a sub-brand, you know.

619
00:20:53,240 --> 00:20:54,960
Cut straight to the "shirt" (point) then!

620
00:20:56,260 --> 00:20:57,480
(Sure! Let's talk "shirts")

621
00:20:57,480 --> 00:20:58,800
Okay, next question.

622
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:01,110
If we entered a martial arts world,

623
00:21:01,110 --> 00:21:05,090
who's most likely to lose it

624
00:21:05,090 --> 00:21:07,200
and become a villain?

625
00:21:08,040 --> 00:21:09,040
(Who'd lose it and become a villain?)
Hu Xianxu.

626
00:21:09,040 --> 00:21:10,120
I picked him too.

627
00:21:10,140 --> 00:21:10,840
(Me?)

628
00:21:10,840 --> 00:21:12,320
I look like a villain?

629
00:21:12,320 --> 00:21:13,440
They mean after you've lost it.

630
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:14,500
Lost it.

631
00:21:14,500 --> 00:21:15,460
(Future villain material)

632
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:17,880
No, you're just really persistent.

633
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:18,480
(Persistent (stubborn))
Yeah.

634
00:21:18,480 --> 00:21:19,880
(Is that a compliment?)
You're the type to...

635
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:21,200
See, whenever we do anything,

636
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:22,760
(Nice save)
we're always so indecisive.

637
00:21:22,760 --> 00:21:23,760
We'd never lose it.

638
00:21:23,820 --> 00:21:25,300
(Does that even make sense?)

639
00:21:27,440 --> 00:21:29,000
Those are all good qualities.

640
00:21:31,120 --> 00:21:32,800
You just never had a good teacher.

641
00:21:34,800 --> 00:21:35,800
How about me and Bing?

642
00:21:35,820 --> 00:21:36,560
(This round: Jia Bing and Hu Xianxu)
Sure.

643
00:21:36,760 --> 00:21:37,440
Here's the deal.

644
00:21:38,040 --> 00:21:39,920
They get the nice questions.
We get the bad ones.

645
00:21:40,280 --> 00:21:40,960
Alright?

646
00:21:40,960 --> 00:21:41,800
Chengcheng and Anyu.

647
00:21:42,100 --> 00:21:44,820
(Didn't hesitate at all)
Come on, all four of you.

648
00:21:44,860 --> 00:21:45,920
(This round: Fan Chengcheng
and Wang Anyu)

649
00:21:45,920 --> 00:21:47,720
Our team's at a disadvantage here.

650
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:49,080
I actually voted for Hu Xianxu.

651
00:21:49,080 --> 00:21:50,480
We're probably...

652
00:21:51,360 --> 00:21:52,280
gonna lose.

653
00:21:52,280 --> 00:21:53,880
All four of us combined

654
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:55,520
can't beat one of theirs,

655
00:21:55,520 --> 00:21:56,080
right?

656
00:21:56,560 --> 00:21:57,560
It's gotta be Wang Anyu.

657
00:21:57,620 --> 00:21:59,100
(Villain in the making. Yikes)

658
00:21:59,320 --> 00:22:00,800
I can't tell if I should be happy

659
00:22:00,800 --> 00:22:02,120
or upset about this.

660
00:22:02,120 --> 00:22:02,800
I give up.

661
00:22:04,040 --> 00:22:05,160
Just admit defeat already.

662
00:22:06,040 --> 00:22:06,360
Alright.

663
00:22:11,160 --> 00:22:13,080
The team with the most votes is...

664
00:22:13,820 --> 00:22:14,520
(As if there's any doubt)

665
00:22:14,520 --> 00:22:15,880
Bing and Hu's team,

666
00:22:15,880 --> 00:22:17,000
apologize to the villain.

667
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:17,980
(Victory)

668
00:22:18,080 --> 00:22:19,280
(Jia Bing: 1, Hu Xianxu: 5, Total: 6)
I give up.

669
00:22:19,280 --> 00:22:21,140
(Fan Chengcheng: 2, Wang Anyu: 6,
Total: 8. Winner)

670
00:22:21,720 --> 00:22:22,600
I totally give up.

671
00:22:22,600 --> 00:22:23,560
But did we two

672
00:22:23,560 --> 00:22:24,320
even beat him?

673
00:22:28,480 --> 00:22:30,240
Your votes combined

674
00:22:30,240 --> 00:22:32,040
tie with one person

675
00:22:32,040 --> 00:22:32,880
from their team.

676
00:22:33,080 --> 00:22:33,320
So Anyu, obviously.

677
00:22:33,320 --> 00:22:34,940
(Not a second of hesitation)
Wang Anyu, obviously.

678
00:22:34,980 --> 00:22:36,860
(His reputation precedes him.
Wang Anyu: 6 votes)

679
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:38,680
Why even build suspense?

680
00:22:40,120 --> 00:22:41,480
Did you vote for yourself?

681
00:22:41,840 --> 00:22:43,920
No, I didn't, but I...

682
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:44,720
Why didn't you?

683
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:47,000
He probably thinks he's really stable.

684
00:22:50,640 --> 00:22:51,920
If he thought he was unstable,

685
00:22:51,920 --> 00:22:53,920
he wouldn't do such unstable things.

686
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:55,600
Wang Churan!

687
00:22:55,600 --> 00:22:57,920
Sound the alarm!

688
00:22:57,920 --> 00:23:00,880
Is that protecting me or just hurting me?

689
00:23:00,880 --> 00:23:02,280
Anyu, I'm calling you out!

690
00:23:02,280 --> 00:23:02,560
Come here!

691
00:23:03,440 --> 00:23:04,000
From now on,

692
00:23:04,960 --> 00:23:06,320
he's my levelheaded little bro.

693
00:23:09,800 --> 00:23:10,920
Come on, Mr. Levelheaded.

694
00:23:14,280 --> 00:23:16,120
If I teamed up with Teng,

695
00:23:16,120 --> 00:23:17,120
would our votes be really high?

696
00:23:17,120 --> 00:23:17,680
Sky-high.

697
00:23:18,040 --> 00:23:18,760
Sky-high?

698
00:23:19,880 --> 00:23:20,960
I got a lot on this one too?

699
00:23:21,360 --> 00:23:22,120
Five votes each.

700
00:23:22,720 --> 00:23:24,600
You think you haven't lost it?

701
00:23:24,600 --> 00:23:26,120
You lost it long ago.

702
00:23:26,120 --> 00:23:27,000
Hu Xianxu!

703
00:23:28,760 --> 00:23:30,400
(Not buying it!)
That's not fair.

704
00:23:30,400 --> 00:23:31,520
You're neck and neck.

705
00:23:31,520 --> 00:23:32,840
That's still quite a few.

706
00:23:32,960 --> 00:23:35,600
After all that trash talk you gave me...

707
00:23:35,620 --> 00:23:37,120
(Two sly foxes.
Neither one's any better)

708
00:23:37,120 --> 00:23:38,760
We still ended up tied.

709
00:23:39,200 --> 00:23:40,640
We really messed this up.

710
00:23:40,640 --> 00:23:41,620
(Not a contest worth winning)

711
00:23:41,760 --> 00:23:43,200
Is there someone even better than us?

712
00:23:43,200 --> 00:23:43,940
(Looking for fellow villains)
Yeah.

713
00:23:44,320 --> 00:23:45,240
Definitely Mr. Huang.

714
00:23:45,440 --> 00:23:46,720
Mr. Huang doesn't even need to lose it.

715
00:23:46,720 --> 00:23:47,440
Mr. Huang got four votes.

716
00:23:47,440 --> 00:23:48,640
(Anyu: 6, Jingyu: 4, Total: 10)
You two also got ten votes combined.

717
00:23:48,800 --> 00:23:50,160
But I'm so emotionally stable.

718
00:23:50,440 --> 00:23:51,920
You mean the guy who threw me yesterday?

719
00:23:52,180 --> 00:23:54,180
(Love)

720
00:23:54,520 --> 00:23:56,280
The guy who, during
the word-guessing game,

721
00:23:56,280 --> 00:23:57,600
(Love)
put me in a rear chokehold?

722
00:23:58,460 --> 00:24:00,780
(Love)

723
00:24:00,820 --> 00:24:03,100
(Love)

724
00:24:07,160 --> 00:24:07,760
We were in the car,

725
00:24:07,760 --> 00:24:08,360
and I turned around

726
00:24:08,360 --> 00:24:09,480
and saw Mr. Huang watching a video.

727
00:24:09,480 --> 00:24:10,280
But when I looked closer,

728
00:24:10,280 --> 00:24:11,400
it was a wrestling video.

729
00:24:11,700 --> 00:24:13,200
(You'll calm down once you hit the floor)

730
00:24:13,200 --> 00:24:14,120
I was like, stop watching!

731
00:24:14,120 --> 00:24:15,960
How many people did you
throw yesterday? Still watching?

732
00:24:15,960 --> 00:24:16,600
No,

733
00:24:16,600 --> 00:24:17,680
he just thought Wang Anyu

734
00:24:17,680 --> 00:24:19,120
didn't fly as far as he'd expected.

735
00:24:22,880 --> 00:24:24,700
(A full review is underway)
Where did I go wrong?

736
00:24:26,040 --> 00:24:27,680
But one of you got zero votes.

737
00:24:27,680 --> 00:24:28,200
Who?

738
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:29,100
(I have questions)

739
00:24:29,320 --> 00:24:30,320
I think it's Bai.

740
00:24:31,360 --> 00:24:31,880
Bai.

741
00:24:32,480 --> 00:24:34,000
He's genuinely levelheaded.

742
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:36,360
Definitely Bai.

743
00:24:36,360 --> 00:24:38,360
He's the calmest guy here.

744
00:24:38,360 --> 00:24:39,840
Even if we're voting
for the biggest nutcase,

745
00:24:39,840 --> 00:24:41,400
he'd never get picked.

746
00:24:42,940 --> 00:24:43,840
(Who's most likely to lose it
and become a villain? Vote tally)

747
00:24:43,840 --> 00:24:45,000
(Bing: 1, Bai: 0, Xianxu: 5, Teng: 5)
Alright, next question.

748
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:45,580
(Chengcheng: 2, Churan: 1, Anyu: 6, Jingyu: 4)

749
00:24:45,690 --> 00:24:51,020
Considering their build,
looks, vibe, and overall style,

750
00:24:51,040 --> 00:24:54,080
who'd make the best kidswear model?

751
00:24:54,080 --> 00:24:55,140
(Who'd make the best kidswear model?)

752
00:24:55,140 --> 00:24:55,880
(I've got a feeling)

753
00:24:55,880 --> 00:24:57,280
Why do I feel
like I'll get a lot of votes?

754
00:24:59,480 --> 00:25:00,120
I know...

755
00:25:00,120 --> 00:25:01,880
I know exactly why they'd pick me.

756
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:02,920
That episode in Italy.

757
00:25:03,480 --> 00:25:04,640
What? Wearing kids' clothes?

758
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:07,160
Tucked into your pants?

759
00:25:07,160 --> 00:25:08,800
I think I picked Chengcheng.

760
00:25:09,720 --> 00:25:10,920
Why didn't you think
of me for the first question?

761
00:25:12,480 --> 00:25:13,760
I picked Bing.

762
00:25:14,480 --> 00:25:15,040
I...

763
00:25:16,720 --> 00:25:17,560
I just wanna see it.

764
00:25:17,780 --> 00:25:18,940
(Curiosity got the better of him)

765
00:25:19,240 --> 00:25:20,400
You and Bing, then.

766
00:25:20,400 --> 00:25:21,600
You must be really bored

767
00:25:21,600 --> 00:25:22,720
to wanna see me wear that.

768
00:25:23,160 --> 00:25:25,160
Someone wants to see Bing wear it too!

769
00:25:26,080 --> 00:25:27,280
You and Bing should stand up.

770
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:28,600
If we're going for the absurd...

771
00:25:28,600 --> 00:25:29,720
Why stop at one?

772
00:25:30,280 --> 00:25:31,200
Double the weirdness?

773
00:25:31,200 --> 00:25:32,080
Double the weirdness.

774
00:25:32,080 --> 00:25:33,820
(This round: Jia Bing and Shen Teng)
Seriously, you two stand up.

775
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:35,400
We need that unexpected contrast.

776
00:25:36,120 --> 00:25:37,080
You two should...

777
00:25:38,360 --> 00:25:39,600
A baby who knows jiu-jitsu?

778
00:25:41,180 --> 00:25:43,060
(Loves that idea)

779
00:25:43,160 --> 00:25:43,840
Then stand up.

780
00:25:43,840 --> 00:25:44,280
I think

781
00:25:44,280 --> 00:25:45,000
you probably got a lot.

782
00:25:52,740 --> 00:25:54,140
(This round: Fan Chengcheng
and Huang Jingyu)

783
00:25:54,140 --> 00:25:54,940
Can...

784
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:57,360
Can you believe this is for kids' clothes?

785
00:25:57,360 --> 00:25:58,620
(Taking the kidswear market by storm)

786
00:25:58,740 --> 00:26:00,260
(Love it. Can't get enough)

787
00:26:00,360 --> 00:26:02,200
These three top kidswear models.

788
00:26:02,420 --> 00:26:03,680
(Three guys you don't wanna mess with)

789
00:26:03,680 --> 00:26:04,720
Aren't these two

790
00:26:04,720 --> 00:26:06,520
gonna get a ton of votes?

791
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:07,920
Whoever gets the most votes

792
00:26:07,920 --> 00:26:09,360
has to wear kids' clothes next episode.

793
00:26:09,540 --> 00:26:11,660
(Their next OOTD is on the line)

794
00:26:11,660 --> 00:26:12,920
The winning team is...

795
00:26:14,080 --> 00:26:15,360
Chengcheng and Jingyu.

796
00:26:15,360 --> 00:26:16,460
(Bing: 3, Teng: 1, Total: 4)

797
00:26:16,460 --> 00:26:17,580
(Chengcheng: 2, Jingyu: 4, Total: 6. Winner)

798
00:26:20,080 --> 00:26:21,560
I give up.

799
00:26:21,840 --> 00:26:22,600
As you should.

800
00:26:24,640 --> 00:26:25,920
Did he get more votes than me?

801
00:26:25,920 --> 00:26:26,240
Yep.

802
00:26:26,560 --> 00:26:27,240
See?

803
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:28,200
Me?

804
00:26:28,760 --> 00:26:29,560
See?

805
00:26:30,840 --> 00:26:32,560
Would we lose if he were on our team?

806
00:26:32,560 --> 00:26:34,520
He alone got more votes
than your whole team.

807
00:26:34,860 --> 00:26:36,100
(Has researched tons
of cartoon characters' last names)

808
00:26:38,840 --> 00:26:39,160
You little punk,

809
00:26:39,160 --> 00:26:40,840
always rooting for this guy and that guy!

810
00:26:43,480 --> 00:26:44,120
