1320
00:43:22,720 --> 00:43:23,342
(Travertine pools get their colors)
It affects the water.

1321
00:43:23,342 --> 00:43:23,920
(from several natural factors.)
It affects the water.

1322
00:43:23,920 --> 00:43:24,713
(Water absorbs longer wavelengths)
And changes how light refracts.

1323
00:43:24,713 --> 00:43:25,360
(like red and orange.)
And changes how light refracts.

1324
00:43:25,360 --> 00:43:25,900
(Shorter wavelengths like blue and green)
The refraction changes.

1325
00:43:25,900 --> 00:43:26,280
(reflect more easily.)
The refraction changes.

1326
00:43:26,280 --> 00:43:27,760
Light gets absorbed and reflected,

1327
00:43:27,760 --> 00:43:29,360
creating all those different colors.

1328
00:43:29,760 --> 00:43:31,280
We got pretty lucky yesterday too.

1329
00:43:31,280 --> 00:43:33,080
We caught the sunlight

1330
00:43:33,080 --> 00:43:34,960
