1343
00:44:47,480 --> 00:44:49,280
Everyone's clearly slowing down.

1344
00:44:49,280 --> 00:44:50,800
Is it the altitude?

1345
00:44:51,360 --> 00:44:51,880
Muscle mass.

1346
00:44:51,880 --> 00:44:53,000
Too much muscle, maybe?

1347
00:44:53,000 --> 00:44:54,420
(Look at those muscles)

1348
00:44:55,680 --> 00:44:57,160
Teng's got you on his sweater.

1349
00:44:57,160 --> 00:44:58,240
I was just about to say that.

1350
00:44:59,960 --> 00:45:01,040
Then I should complete the look.

1351
00:45:01,040 --> 00:45:01,800
Just need a little red hat.

1352
00:45:01,800 --> 00:45:02,600
Hang on a second.

1353
00:45:04,480 --> 00:45:05,320
Let's get going!

1354
00:45:05,720 --> 00:45:06,480
Take it slow.

1355
00:45:07,160 --> 00:45:08,600
We're here at Huanglong.

1356
00:45:08,600 --> 00:45:09,560
The elevation here...

1357
00:45:09,560 --> 00:45:10,520
Yesterday was 2,400 meters.

1358
00:45:10,520 --> 00:45:11,800
Now we're over 3,100 meters.

1359
00:45:11,800 --> 00:45:12,880
We're at 3,200 meters.

1360
00:45:13,640 --> 00:45:15,800
It's higher here than yesterday.

1361
00:45:15,800 --> 00:45:16,840
Much higher.

1362
00:45:16,840 --> 00:45:17,960
Over 3,000 meters.

1363
00:45:18,640 --> 00:45:19,560
So look at the vegetation.

1364
00:45:19,560 --> 00:45:21,080
It's changed quite a bit.

1365
00:45:21,080 --> 00:45:23,360
These are mostly fir and spruce trees,

1366
00:45:23,360 --> 00:45:24,160
adapted to the cold.

1367
00:45:30,880 --> 00:45:32,000
That's spruce, right?

1368
00:45:32,000 --> 00:45:33,880
Fir. That's a fir tree.

1369
00:45:33,880 --> 00:45:34,320
Fir?

1370
00:45:34,320 --> 00:45:34,840
Yeah.

1371
00:45:35,160 --> 00:45:36,440
Let me show you something cool.

1372
00:45:36,920 --> 00:45:37,400
Where?

1373
00:45:38,060 --> 00:45:38,840
(Shaking the branches)
Look.

1374
00:45:38,840 --> 00:45:40,000
(Branch shaking is a scientific method.)
There aren't any bugs.

1375
00:45:40,000 --> 00:45:40,820
(Shaking trees or branches
makes insects lose their grip and fall.)

1376
00:45:40,880 --> 00:45:41,640
But

1377
00:45:41,640 --> 00:45:42,840
on every single tree,

1378
00:45:45,760 --> 00:45:46,600
look closely.

1379
00:45:46,960 --> 00:45:48,620
(All eyes here)
There are tons of spiders.

1380
00:45:48,720 --> 00:45:49,080
And...

1381
00:45:49,080 --> 00:45:49,640
Where?

1382
00:45:49,640 --> 00:45:50,640
Look, a spider.

1383
00:45:50,640 --> 00:45:51,240
That one's jumping.

1384
00:45:51,240 --> 00:45:51,760
And look.

1385
00:45:52,960 --> 00:45:54,360
(Curious)
This is a barklouse.

1386
00:45:54,360 --> 00:45:55,680
A big-eyed barklouse.

1387
00:45:55,680 --> 00:45:57,960
Planthoppers and spiders too.

1388
00:45:57,960 --> 00:45:59,160
Over the past 15 years,

1389
00:45:59,160 --> 00:46:00,600
right here on these fir trees,

1390
00:46:00,600 --> 00:46:01,960
I've discovered hundreds of new species.

1391
00:46:01,960 --> 00:46:03,040
This is how I found them.

1392
00:46:03,520 --> 00:46:04,720
They might look bare,

1393
00:46:04,720 --> 00:46:05,800
like there's nothing living here.

1394
00:46:05,800 --> 00:46:06,960
But every branch

1395
00:46:06,960 --> 00:46:08,560
is full of tiny insects.

1396
00:46:08,660 --> 00:46:13,100
(Quiet on the surface,
but full of hidden life)

1397
00:46:13,280 --> 00:46:14,640
Is this related to pine trees?

1398
00:46:14,640 --> 00:46:16,280
Yeah, they're gymnosperms.

1399
00:46:16,280 --> 00:46:17,600
Relatives of pine trees.

1400
00:46:17,600 --> 00:46:18,280
Fir trees.

1401
00:46:18,840 --> 00:46:20,480
They look like dawn redwoods too.

1402
00:46:20,480 --> 00:46:21,600
Yes, they're all conifers.

1403
00:46:22,480 --> 00:46:23,320
This

1404
00:46:23,760 --> 00:46:25,360
is the most famous sight here.

1405
00:46:25,360 --> 00:46:26,280
We've reached the travertine pools!

1406
00:46:30,920 --> 00:46:31,720
Everyone, look!

1407
00:46:31,720 --> 00:46:33,040
Doesn't this look really different

1408
00:46:33,040 --> 00:46:34,320
from yesterday's Five Flower Lake?

1409
00:46:35,160 --> 00:46:36,520
This is fascinating.

1410
00:46:36,520 --> 00:46:38,400
It kinda looks like rice terraces.

1411
00:46:38,400 --> 00:46:39,240
Exactly.

1412
00:46:39,240 --> 00:46:40,280
Does anyone know

1413
00:46:40,280 --> 00:46:41,280
how these terraces formed?

1414
00:46:41,720 --> 00:46:43,640
Like stalactites, right?

1415
00:46:43,640 --> 00:46:44,240
Yeah.

1416
00:46:44,240 --> 00:46:46,240
It all goes back to calcium carbonate

1417
00:46:46,240 --> 00:46:48,160
from shells 400 million years ago.

1418
00:46:48,520 --> 00:46:49,440
These mineral deposits

1419
00:46:49,440 --> 00:46:51,560
come from springs up above.

1420
00:46:51,560 --> 00:46:52,840
The water forms a waterfall.

1421
00:46:53,480 --> 00:46:55,920
When the mineral-rich water hits a rock,

1422
00:46:55,920 --> 00:46:57,960
it starts swirling around.

1423
00:46:57,960 --> 00:47:00,440
Minerals slowly build up
along the edges,

1424
00:47:00,440 --> 00:47:01,800
forming a pool.

1425
00:47:02,000 --> 00:47:03,080
Then the water

1426
00:47:03,080 --> 00:47:04,960
finds the lowest opening

1427
00:47:04,960 --> 00:47:05,880
and flows down.

1428
00:47:06,080 --> 00:47:07,400
It swirls around again,

1429
00:47:07,400 --> 00:47:08,840
depositing more minerals

1430
00:47:08,840 --> 00:47:09,880
and forming another pool.

1431
00:47:09,880 --> 00:47:10,720
Over time,

1432
00:47:10,720 --> 00:47:12,560
these terraces gradually form.

1433
00:47:13,440 --> 00:47:14,800
That's what makes Huanglong special.

1434
00:47:16,320 --> 00:47:17,800
Let's rest before heading up.

1435
00:47:17,800 --> 00:47:18,680
Keep going! Don't stop!

1436
00:47:19,260 --> 00:47:19,880
(Just power through!)

1437
00:47:19,880 --> 00:47:20,640
Let's run!

1438
00:47:20,640 --> 00:47:21,880
Not bad!

1439
00:47:22,320 --> 00:47:23,040
Let him walk in front.

1440
00:47:23,040 --> 00:47:25,000
If he falls behind us, we'd never know.

1441
00:47:25,340 --> 00:47:27,280
(Chen Rui)

1442
00:47:27,280 --> 00:47:28,600
Is that our destination?

1443
00:47:28,600 --> 00:47:29,720
Yeah, that viewing platform.

1444
00:47:29,720 --> 00:47:30,520
We're here already?

1445
00:47:30,520 --> 00:47:32,040
Almost. Just 20 meters left.

1446
00:47:32,520 --> 00:47:33,840
Only 20 meters? Let's go.

1447
00:47:33,840 --> 00:47:34,520
Easy!

1448
00:47:34,520 --> 00:47:35,960
That's barely a hike.

1449
00:47:35,960 --> 00:47:37,980
(His hiking pole
hasn't even kicked in yet)

1450
00:47:39,560 --> 00:47:40,360
You haven't hiked enough?

1451
00:47:41,080 --> 00:47:42,400
Go back down and do another lap.

1452
00:47:42,400 --> 00:47:43,640
That was nothing.

1453
00:47:46,080 --> 00:47:47,160
Let's run straight to the top.

1454
00:47:47,160 --> 00:47:47,600
(Challenge accepted?)
Let's go!

1455
00:47:47,600 --> 00:47:48,160
You in?

1456
00:47:48,160 --> 00:47:48,680
Let's go.

1457
00:47:52,360 --> 00:47:52,720
Slow down.

1458
00:47:52,720 --> 00:47:53,400
You'll wear yourself out.

1459
00:47:57,960 --> 00:47:59,010
(Easy work)
This altitude's nothing.

1460
00:48:00,120 --> 00:48:00,920
These youngsters...

1461
00:48:00,920 --> 00:48:02,200
(Gasping for air)

1462
00:48:02,200 --> 00:48:03,880
The older guys kept dragging behind.

1463
00:48:03,880 --> 00:48:05,120
Been waiting for them all the way.

1464
00:48:05,120 --> 00:48:06,120
(Gasping for air)

1465
00:48:06,120 --> 00:48:06,840
Still waiting.

1466
00:48:07,320 --> 00:48:08,440
Otherwise, I'd be here by morning.

1467
00:48:08,540 --> 00:48:09,940
(Too proud to admit defeat)

1468
00:48:10,360 --> 00:48:11,120
Like walking on flat ground!

1469
00:48:11,120 --> 00:48:12,540
(Fired up)

1470
00:48:13,000 --> 00:48:13,760
Easy as walking!

1471
00:48:16,100 --> 00:48:18,340
(Finally showing off)

1472
00:48:18,400 --> 00:48:20,320
Not even out of breath, guys!

1473
00:48:21,280 --> 00:48:22,600
Ran the whole way up.

1474
00:48:22,600 --> 00:48:23,280
Didn't stop once.

1475
00:48:23,280 --> 00:48:24,040
Well, look.

1476
00:48:24,040 --> 00:48:26,160
Here come the professional hikers!

1477
00:48:26,520 --> 00:48:27,720
Chengcheng even

1478
00:48:27,720 --> 00:48:29,120
changed his hairstyle this time.

1479
00:48:29,120 --> 00:48:30,200
This looks good too.

1480
00:48:30,200 --> 00:48:31,300
(Loving the compliment)

1481
00:48:31,360 --> 00:48:33,840
Kinda looks like I copied Bing's style.

1482
00:48:33,840 --> 00:48:34,120
Yeah.

1483
00:48:34,120 --> 00:48:35,120
From last season.

1484
00:48:35,120 --> 00:48:36,520
(All grown up)
You're copying Bing a bit.

1485
00:48:37,680 --> 00:48:38,160
Oh my gosh.

1486
00:48:38,160 --> 00:48:39,350
They look like swimming pools.

1487
00:48:39,350 --> 00:48:39,790
Wow!

1488
00:48:40,740 --> 00:48:41,500
Oh my gosh!

1489
00:48:45,120 --> 00:48:46,320
You know thos.

1490
00:48:46,320 --> 00:48:49,680
pools at island resorts
and luxury condos?

1491
00:48:49,680 --> 00:48:50,440
Aren't they...

1492
00:48:50,440 --> 00:48:51,600
Designed to look like this.

1493
00:48:51,600 --> 00:48:52,800
They basically copied this.

1494
00:48:54,960 --> 00:48:56,080
Looks like hot springs.

1495
00:48:56,080 --> 00:48:56,760
Gorgeous!

1496
00:48:57,920 --> 00:48:59,040
So pretty! Take a picture of me!

1497
00:48:59,040 --> 00:49:00,440
Nice outfit!

1498
00:49:00,440 --> 00:49:01,600
I got the idea

1499
00:49:01,600 --> 00:49:03,960
from Tmall's
Double 11 fall fashion gift box.

1500
00:49:03,960 --> 00:49:05,680
Search "Natural High" on Taobao,

1501
00:49:05,680 --> 00:49:07,880
and you could win
the same fall outfit I'm holding!

1502
00:49:07,880 --> 00:49:10,040
Share with friends
for even more perks and surprises!

1503
00:49:10,040 --> 00:49:11,160
Tmall's Double 11 sale is here!

1504
00:49:11,160 --> 00:49:12,880
Search "Natural High" on Taobao

1505
00:49:12,880 --> 00:49:15,320
and sign up
for my October 31 livestream!

1506
00:49:15,320 --> 00:49:18,080
Tons of exclusive laughs
and surprises await!

1507
00:49:21,320 --> 00:49:22,680
They brought out the nuts again?

1508
00:49:23,240 --> 00:49:24,600
Bing isn't cooking tonight.

1509
00:49:24,600 --> 00:49:25,680
So everyone,

1510
00:49:25,680 --> 00:49:27,000
fill up on nuts for now.

1511
00:49:34,360 --> 00:49:34,840
I told you.

1512
00:49:34,840 --> 00:49:36,440
Stop putting these out.

1513
00:49:36,440 --> 00:49:37,220
(Too tempting to resist)

1514
00:49:37,320 --> 00:49:38,120
I'll take them away.

1515
00:49:38,120 --> 00:49:38,600
It's fine, Teng.

1516
00:49:38,600 --> 00:49:40,320
You're eating the ones without shells.

1517
00:49:40,320 --> 00:49:41,400
No one can tell how much you've eaten.

1518
00:49:41,400 --> 00:49:41,960
(No evidence, no calories)

1519
00:49:41,960 --> 00:49:42,480
Exactly, Teng.

1520
00:49:42,480 --> 00:49:43,720
I've already finished
all the beef jerky.

1521
00:49:44,980 --> 00:49:47,820
(Time to refuel)

1522
00:49:48,560 --> 00:49:49,600
He literally just said it.

1523
00:49:49,600 --> 00:49:50,240
Just said it.

1524
00:49:50,240 --> 00:49:51,040
Stop putting these out.

1525
00:49:51,040 --> 00:49:51,600
And straight into his mouth.

1526
00:49:52,280 --> 00:49:53,600
Stop putting these out!
I'll eat them all!

1527
00:49:53,860 --> 00:49:55,540
(Don't put them here.
Put them in my mouth)

1528
00:49:58,920 --> 00:50:00,880
Welcome, Natural High crew!

1529
00:50:00,880 --> 00:50:02,160
You've arrived in high spirits

1530
00:50:02,160 --> 00:50:03,640
here in beautiful Songpan!

1531
00:50:05,440 --> 00:50:06,440
As you all saw,

1532
00:50:06,440 --> 00:50:07,480
the water here

1533
00:50:07,480 --> 00:50:09,080
flows down

1534
00:50:09,080 --> 00:50:10,600
from one level to the next.

1535
00:50:10,600 --> 00:50:12,120
So today, we're doing

1536
00:50:12,120 --> 00:50:14,000
a challenge about passing things along,

1537
00:50:14,000 --> 00:50:15,720
inspired by the scenery.

1538
00:50:15,720 --> 00:50:17,080
The challenge is called

1539
00:50:17,080 --> 00:50:18,640
Reverse Story Challenge.

1540
00:50:18,660 --> 00:50:19,880
(Reverse Story)

1541
00:50:19,880 --> 00:50:21,360
You'll split into teams of four.

1542
00:50:21,360 --> 00:50:22,920
(Reverse Story: Teams of four)
Each round, you'll pass along

1543
00:50:22,920 --> 00:50:24,040
(Pass clues by acting within the time limit)
a character

1544
00:50:24,040 --> 00:50:25,800
(A character doing something in a certain mood)
doing something in a certain mood.

1545
00:50:25,800 --> 00:50:26,320
(The last player guesses)
For example,

1546
00:50:26,320 --> 00:50:27,040
(The team guessing the most characters wins)
Zhuangzhuang's mom

1547
00:50:27,040 --> 00:50:28,680
sadly playing dodgeball.

1548
00:50:28,680 --> 00:50:30,720
Within the time limit,

1549
00:50:30,720 --> 00:50:32,120
each player instructs the next person

1550
00:50:32,120 --> 00:50:33,360
to act out the clue.

1551
00:50:33,360 --> 00:50:34,600
The next person

1552
00:50:34,600 --> 00:50:36,760
figures it out and passes it on.

1553
00:50:36,760 --> 00:50:37,960
The last person guesses.

1554
00:50:37,960 --> 00:50:40,160
The team that gets
the most characters right wins.

1555
00:50:40,840 --> 00:50:41,640
Let's split down the middle.

1556
00:50:41,940 --> 00:50:43,660
(Splitting into two teams)

1557
00:50:44,200 --> 00:50:44,840
Okay!

1558
00:50:51,120 --> 00:50:52,360
Teng just gave me a look.

1559
00:50:52,360 --> 00:50:53,400
No idea what that meant.

1560
00:50:53,760 --> 00:50:55,000
Fine, three of us can carry one.

1561
00:50:56,680 --> 00:50:57,960
Three youngsters carrying one old guy.

1562
00:51:00,080 --> 00:51:02,040
Which team wants to practice first?

1563
00:51:02,320 --> 00:51:03,520
You three carrying one wanna go first?

1564
00:51:03,840 --> 00:51:04,360
I'll go first.

1565
00:51:04,520 --> 00:51:05,120
Come on!

1566
00:51:05,460 --> 00:51:07,140
(Distraction music is on)

1567
00:51:07,180 --> 00:51:14,740
(A 40-something guy
squeezing in a workout)

1568
00:51:14,780 --> 00:51:15,125
(Practice: A mermaid)
Nine characters.

1569
00:51:15,125 --> 00:51:15,640
(boldly performs molten iron fireworks)
Nine characters.

1570
00:51:15,640 --> 00:51:16,600
First three characters. Lie down.

1571
00:51:16,880 --> 00:51:17,240
Lie down.

1572
00:51:17,240 --> 00:51:18,440
Lie sideways.

1573
00:51:18,720 --> 00:51:19,280
Sideways.

1574
00:51:19,280 --> 00:51:19,760
Giving up?

1575
00:51:19,820 --> 00:51:21,180
(Giving up)

1576
00:51:21,320 --> 00:51:23,080
Lie on your side.

1577
00:51:23,080 --> 00:51:23,840
Then

1578
00:51:23,840 --> 00:51:25,280
keep flapping your feet.

1579
00:51:26,680 --> 00:51:27,240
Freestyle swimming?

1580
00:51:27,240 --> 00:51:27,600
No.

1581
00:51:27,600 --> 00:51:28,160
Both feet.

1582
00:51:28,160 --> 00:51:28,840
Backstroke?

1583
00:51:28,840 --> 00:51:30,360
Keep them together.

1584
00:51:30,360 --> 00:51:31,280
Flap both feet together.

1585
00:51:31,600 --> 00:51:32,240
Keep flapping.

1586
00:51:33,480 --> 00:51:34,760
Now flip your hair!

1587
00:51:35,840 --> 00:51:36,960
Yes. It's a character.

1588
00:51:37,840 --> 00:51:38,680
A character?

1589
00:51:39,440 --> 00:51:40,200
Who is that supposed to be?

1590
00:51:40,200 --> 00:51:40,880
(Physically interrupting)
Get up!

1591
00:51:40,880 --> 00:51:41,360
Stand up!

1592
00:51:42,080 --> 00:51:42,680
Stand up!

1593
00:51:43,520 --> 00:51:44,320
Walk forward.

1594
00:51:44,320 --> 00:51:45,240
With a really...

1595
00:51:47,600 --> 00:51:48,680
While...

1596
00:51:49,720 --> 00:51:51,480
Looking totally unimpressed.

1597
00:51:54,080 --> 00:51:55,160
Something like that.

1598
00:51:55,360 --> 00:51:56,320
Looking annoyed.

1599
00:51:56,320 --> 00:51:57,860
(I've been sick of you for ages)

1600
00:52:00,240 --> 00:52:01,040
Close enough.

1601
00:52:01,040 --> 00:52:02,120
Okay, last three characters.

1602
00:52:02,840 --> 00:52:04,160
Crouch down. On one knee.

1603
00:52:05,200 --> 00:52:06,600
Raise one hand.

1604
00:52:07,320 --> 00:52:07,880
Make a fist.

1605
00:52:08,480 --> 00:52:09,600
Keep pounding downward.

1606
00:52:10,440 --> 00:52:11,200
Hold it with your other hand.

1607
00:52:11,760 --> 00:52:12,960
There's something

1608
00:52:12,960 --> 00:52:14,200
where you're pounding.

1609
00:52:14,200 --> 00:52:14,880
Whac-A-Mole?

1610
00:52:14,880 --> 00:52:16,520
There's something where you're pounding.

1611
00:52:16,520 --> 00:52:17,480
Right under your hand.

1612
00:52:17,480 --> 00:52:18,120
Time's up.

1613
00:52:24,960 --> 00:52:26,400
No, that's way too much information.

1614
00:52:26,400 --> 00:52:27,120
(Information overload)
Keep flapping.

1615
00:52:27,120 --> 00:52:27,800
Walk forward.

1616
00:52:27,800 --> 00:52:28,080
One knee down.

1617
00:52:28,080 --> 00:52:29,200
Keep pounding downward.

1618
00:52:29,920 --> 00:52:31,600
What kind of scene
is that supposed to be?

1619
00:52:31,600 --> 00:52:32,320
Keep flapping.

1620
00:52:32,320 --> 00:52:33,000
