And even worse, to me.

2184
01:10:12,380 --> 01:10:13,880
Remote-Control Charades.

2185
01:10:13,880 --> 01:10:14,880
Did I say you could eat that?

2186
01:10:15,680 --> 01:10:16,440
Stop hitting me!

2187
01:10:16,440 --> 01:10:17,600
Are you really that greedy?

2188
01:10:17,800 --> 01:10:18,480
(Giving a command)
Switch roles.

2189
01:10:18,500 --> 01:10:19,340
(Uh-oh)

2190
01:10:19,520 --> 01:10:20,600
Did I tell you to eat it?

2191
01:10:20,600 --> 01:10:21,320
And you just ate it?

2192
01:10:21,320 --> 01:10:22,480
Sorry, ma'am!

2193
01:10:22,480 --> 01:10:23,480
It was just too delicious!

2194
01:10:24,420 --> 01:10:25,360
(Song-Guessing Auction)

2195
01:10:25,360 --> 01:10:26,400
Okay, we'll listen for ten seconds.

2196
01:10:26,400 --> 01:10:27,040
Three seconds!

2197
01:10:27,460 --> 01:10:28,260
Huh?

2198
01:10:28,440 --> 01:10:29,020
I'm very happy.

2199
01:10:29,020 --> 01:10:29,740
(Wrong answer)

2200
01:10:29,800 --> 01:10:30,680
Not bad. Pretty cool.

2201
01:10:30,680 --> 01:10:31,680
This guy's something else!

2202
01:10:33,280 --> 01:10:34,560
Dream come true.

2203
01:10:35,080 --> 01:10:36,200
Wolverine!

2204
01:10:36,200 --> 01:10:36,920
Isn't that

2205
01:10:36,920 --> 01:10:38,120
No-Face?

2206
01:10:38,320 --> 01:10:39,200
A new masterpiece!

2207
01:10:39,200 --> 01:10:39,680
Monkey King!

2208
01:10:40,000 --> 01:10:41,160
Play the music!

2209
01:10:41,320 --> 01:10:41,960
Music!

2210
01:10:42,120 --> 01:10:42,800
Come on!

2211
01:10:42,800 --> 01:10:44,200
Natural High!

2212
01:10:44,200 --> 01:10:46,000
Let's go!

2213
01:10:46,020 --> 01:10:47,540
Reverse Story Challenge.

2214
01:10:47,680 --> 01:10:48,600
(Bonus episode preview)
Get on all fours.

2215
01:10:48,620 --> 01:10:49,240
(Obediently follows)

2216
01:10:49,240 --> 01:10:50,520
Crawl toward me.

2217
01:10:50,520 --> 01:10:50,880
Crawl.

2218
01:10:50,880 --> 01:10:52,200
Hurry up!

2219
01:10:52,220 --> 01:10:53,220
(What's this?)

2220
01:10:53,520 --> 01:10:54,960
That has nothing to do with it.

2221
01:10:56,000 --> 01:10:57,280
Just wasting your oxygen.

2222
01:10:58,560 --> 01:10:59,840
You need to grab something

2223
01:10:59,840 --> 01:11:00,720
(Fanning)
and fan yourself with it.

2224
01:11:01,060 --> 01:11:01,620
(Thinks for 0.1 seconds)

2225
01:11:02,880 --> 01:11:04,880
(Does that sound like a good guy?)
A guy charging up a mountain with a chainsaw?

2226
01:11:04,880 --> 01:11:06,840
(How can you not recognize him?)
You have to guess who he is first!

2227
01:11:08,040 --> 01:11:09,360
(Hands)
Turn your palms upward.

2228
01:11:09,360 --> 01:11:09,920
Both hands.

2229
01:11:10,640 --> 01:11:11,640
It's an attitude.

2230
01:11:12,500 --> 01:11:13,860
(An attitude?)

2231
01:11:14,060 --> 01:11:15,420
(Can't watch this anymore)

2232
01:11:15,760 --> 01:11:16,960
Let's get serious, guys.

2233
01:11:16,960 --> 01:11:18,040
Now you're taking it seriously.

2234
01:11:18,040 --> 01:11:19,680
This gesture is also called...

2235
01:11:19,680 --> 01:11:20,160
Slitting the throat.

2236
01:11:20,160 --> 01:11:20,660
(Just say it)

2237
01:11:21,640 --> 01:11:22,640
Mommy?

2238
01:11:23,560 --> 01:11:25,240
What do these two gestures
mean together?

2239
01:11:25,520 --> 01:11:26,920
Suicidal tear-wiping?

2240
01:11:28,260 --> 01:11:28,680
(Shoveling it in)

2241
01:11:28,680 --> 01:11:29,920
Okay, just that gesture!

2242
01:11:29,920 --> 01:11:31,480
Show it to either of those two,

2243
01:11:31,480 --> 01:11:32,560
and they'll know who it is.

2244
01:11:32,720 --> 01:11:33,560
Shovel it into your mouth.

2245
01:11:34,540 --> 01:11:35,720
(Say no more)

2246
01:11:35,720 --> 01:11:36,320
Jia Bing.

2247
01:11:37,920 --> 01:11:38,440
Bing!

2248
01:11:39,120 --> 01:11:40,840
Bing, what kind
of reputation do you have?

2249
01:11:40,840 --> 01:11:42,240
This is hilarious!

2250
01:11:42,460 --> 01:11:44,620
(You Describe, I Act:
Reverse Story showdown coming soon)

2251
01:11:44,620 --> 01:12:05,860
(Natural High S4 Viewing Calendar)
